<li>pattern: <code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">.*</span></code></li>
</ul>
</div></blockquote>
</div></blockquote>
</div></blockquote>
</div></blockquote>
</div></blockquote>
<p>Count -&gt; (structure)</p>
<blockquote>
<div><p>Instructs WAF to count the web request and then continue evaluating the request using the remaining rules in the web ACL.</p>
<p>CustomRequestHandling -&gt; (structure)</p>
<blockquote>
<div><p>Defines custom handling for the web request.</p>
