<p>JSON example: <code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">&quot;SuccessValues&quot;:</span> <span class="pre">[</span> <span class="pre">&quot;True&quot;,</span> <span class="pre">&quot;Succeeded&quot;</span> <span class="pre">]</span></code></p>
